If she wants to know what the question was, she has to drink.

494
00:16:25,909 --> 00:16:27,178
(She must drink a shot to find out.)

495
00:16:27,179 --> 00:16:28,648
- So...
- It's not chocolate milk?

496
00:16:28,649 --> 00:16:29,848
- It's alcohol?
- She has to drink alcohol.

497
00:16:29,849 --> 00:16:31,278
- Like the penalty drink.
- To heighten...

498
00:16:31,279 --> 00:16:32,779
