- "I've done my work."

566
00:18:56,189 --> 00:18:57,528
- "I'm done here."
- I totally get it.

567
00:18:57,529 --> 00:18:59,258
- "I've done my work."
- "I'm done here."

568
00:18:59,259 --> 00:19:01,328
- "I made them who they are now."
- Right.

569
00:19:01,329 --> 00:19:02,768
- It's like that. Yes.
- Right.

